# Proposed evidence-tool components; none is implemented or qualified by this design.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Proposed attempt coordinator\nFixed permission + matched qualified tools + fresh output\nPure mode cannot read installed reference roots" {class: start}
Source: "Fixed source adapter\nmdfind -0 · exact predicate · raw stdout / stderr\nSlot ordinals + actual terminal / reap"
Held: "Held acquisition adapter\nComponent scope + root / base identities\nClosed layouts / fixed files / direct locales"
Objects: "Original evidence objects\nComplete bytes or exact failed prefixes\nEvery source / copy / file / alias occurrence retained"
Decoder: "In-process Core Foundation decoder\nFormat / error + complete type-ID walk\nUTF-16 / data / exact number and date observations"
Envelope: "Closed proposed envelope version 1\nTrees / candidates / flags / tables / LocProvenance\nJoint tails + item-by-item closure + frozen tools"
Oracle: "Separately frozen independent expectation\nAuthored specimen bytes / types / inventories / associations\nFault contact trace + intended negative reasons"
Verifier: "Independent offline verifier\nRecompute every coordinate; totals are not the oracle\nOriginal hashes cannot qualify generated rewrites"
Boundary: "Design selected · executable schema / tool / proofs unbuilt\nK244 remains live · one target pass unused\nNo finite subject, private eligibility or native verdict"
Start -> Source: "1 · packaging only after pure qualification"
Source -> Held: "2 · complete framed terminal response"
Held -> Objects: "3 · no-follow reads and raw observations"
Objects -> Decoder: "4 · bytes only; no target pathname"
Objects -> Envelope: "5a · originals stay separate"
Decoder -> Envelope: "5b · full witness or explicit typed failure"
Envelope -> Verifier: "6 · package and all associations"
Oracle -> Verifier: "6 · independent expected facts"
Verifier -> Boundary: "7 · construction must observe all controls"
